    "preamble": "M/S. Seema Sweets vs The State Of Assam And 4 Ors on 2 August, 2024 Page No.# 1/2 Gahc010103952020 The Gauhati High Court (High Court Of Assam, Nagaland, Mizoram And Arunachal Pradesh) Case No. : Wp(C)/3061/2020 M/S. Seema Sweets A Proprietorial Concern Established At A.T. Road, Jorhat Town Under P.O. And P.S. Jorhat, Dist. Jorhat, Assam, Rep. By Its Sole Proprietor Sri Ramniket Gupta. Versus The State Of Assam And 4 Ors. Rep. By The Secretary To The Govt. Of Assam In The Urban Development Deptt., D Block, 2Nd Floor, Janata Bhawan, Dispur, Guwahati-781006. 2:The Dy. Commissioner Jorhat-785001 3:The Director Municipal Administrative Deptt. Govt. Of Assam Dispur Guwahati-781006. 4:The Jorhat Municipal Board Rep. By Its Executive Officer Having Its Office At A.T. Road 2Nd Floor Unnayan Bhawan Jorhat P.O. And P.S. And Dist. Jorhat Page No.# 2/2 Assam-785001. M/S. Seema Sweets vs The State Of Assam And 4 Ors on 2 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/25987084/ 1 5:The Designated Officer Food Safety Office Of The Joint Director Of Health Services Sivasagar (Having Jurisdiction In The Sivasagar Jorhat Tinsukia Dibrugar And Golaghat) Under Deptt. Of Health And Family Welfare Ground Floor Block-D Assam Secretariat Dispur Guwahati-781006 Advocate for the Petitioner : Mr H Gupta, Ms. R M Sarmah,Ms. S Bhattacharjee Advocate for the Respondent : Ga, Assam, Sc, Health,Sc, J M B",
